{"seq":3,"slug":"pricing-strategy-and-unit-economics","title":"定价策略与单位经济模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/pricing-strategy-and-unit-economics","wordCount":1881,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"定价策略与单位经济模型\">定价策略与单位经济模型</h1><p>Intercom 把 Fin 客服 agent 的价签从「按席位」改成「每解决一张工单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.99</mn><mtext>」，</mtext><mi>H</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>在</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年</mtext><mn>4</mn><mtext>月又把同类的</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>从</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.99」，HubSpot 在 2026 年 4 月又把同类的 Customer Agent 从</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">」，</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月又把同类的</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">从</span></span></span></span></span>1.00 砍到 $0.50/单——这不是促销，而是平台竞争把定价权重新分配的信号。当推理成本变成营业成本（COGS）里逐 token 计量的真实开销，定价不再只是市场部决定的数字，它直接咬住毛利率、咬住护城河能否撑住。本文把「怎么定价」和「这门生意到底赚不赚钱」绑在一起看：单位经济模型决定了你在价格战里能跌到多深而不死，而定价模型决定了你的毛利对推理成本的敏感度有多高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从席位费到-token-税\">核心概念：从席位费到 token 税</h2><p>传统 SaaS 的变动成本只占收入的 10–20%，毛利稳在 75–85%。AI 产品不一样：每做出 100 万美元收入，约 23 万美元在任何工程师、销售拿到工资之前就以推理成本流出去了（<a href=\"https://www.saasmag.com/ai-cogs-saas-gross-margin-compression/\">SaaSMag, 2026</a>）。这笔结构性的、按用量计的开销有个名字——<strong>token 税（token tax）</strong>：任何在「自己不拥有的推理」之上搭产品的公司都得交。ICONIQ 的《2026 State of AI》给出量级：AI 原生产品的平均毛利 2024 年 41%、2025 年 45%、2026 年预计 52%，即便涨到 52% 也仍比成熟 SaaS 低 23–33 个百分点（<a href=\"https://www.techtimes.com/articles/317542/20260601/ai-agent-economics-token-tax-locks-gross-margins-30-points-below-saas-baseline.htm\">TechTimes, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>下图把一笔 AI 产品收入拆开，看 token 税卡在哪个环节：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一笔 AI 产品收入&lt;br/&gt;$1.00] --&gt; B[推理 token 成本&lt;br/&gt;约 $0.23 COGS]&#10;  A --&gt; C[毛利留存&lt;br/&gt;约 $0.52]&#10;  A --&gt; D[其余基础设施税&lt;br/&gt;检索/索引/监控/人工复核]&#10;  B --&gt; E[定价模型决定&lt;br/&gt;谁承担用量波动]&#10;  C --&gt; F[护城河决定&lt;br/&gt;能否抵御价格战]&#10;  E --&gt; G{单位经济是否为正}&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[可持续平台&lt;br/&gt;vs 烧钱补贴]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一笔 AI 产品收入&lt;br/&gt;$1.00] --&gt; B[推理 token 成本&lt;br/&gt;约 $0.23 COGS]\n  A --&gt; C[毛利留存&lt;br/&gt;约 $0.52]\n  A --&gt; D[其余基础设施税&lt;br/&gt;检索/索引/监控/人工复核]\n  B --&gt; E[定价模型决定&lt;br/&gt;谁承担用量波动]\n  C --&gt; F[护城河决定&lt;br/&gt;能否抵御价格战]\n  E --&gt; G{单位经济是否为正}\n  F --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[可持续平台&lt;br/&gt;vs 烧钱补贴]</pre><p>席位定价正在崩。因为 AI agent 不登录、不持有 license、能自主跑完整个工作流，按席位收费失去了计量基础：席位制在 12 个月内从占 SaaS 公司的 21% 跌到 15%，混合模型（base + overage）从 27% 飙到 41%（<a href=\"https://www.getmonetizely.com/blogs/the-2026-guide-to-saas-ai-and-agentic-pricing-models\">Monetizely, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种定价模型与它们的毛利敏感度\">三种定价模型与它们的毛利敏感度</h2><p>2026 年三种主流模型并存，区别在于「谁承担用量波动的风险」，以及毛利对推理价格的敏感度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>计量单位</th>\n<th>风险承担方</th>\n<th>毛利对 token 价的敏感度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>席位制</td>\n<td>每用户/月</td>\n<td>厂商（重度用户拖垮毛利）</td>\n<td>高且不可控</td>\n<td>用量均匀的协作工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用量制</td>\n<td>每 token / API 调用</td>\n<td>客户</td>\n<td>低（成本直接转嫁）</td>\n<td>开发者 API、波动大的负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果制</td>\n<td>每解决/每成交</td>\n<td>厂商，但定价含缓冲</td>\n<td>中（取决于每结果耗 token）</td>\n<td>定义清晰、可重复的工作流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合制</td>\n<td>base + overage</td>\n<td>双方分担</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>多数企业 SaaS（41% 落点）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用量制把成本风险整段转嫁给客户，所以厂商毛利最稳——这也是开发者 API 普遍按 token 计价的原因。结果制最激进：客户只为达成的结果付钱。但它只在「定义清晰、可重复」的工作流里成立，客服是最典型的赢家（<a href=\"https://dev.to/korix/ai-pricing-models-per-seat-vs-per-use-vs-outcome-2026-32ep\">korix, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>把结果制的毛利算清楚很关键。一次客服工单解决通常涉及 3–5 次 API 调用，每次处理 500–2000 token；按 GPT-4o 级模型算，单次解决的推理成本只有几美分。所以 Intercom 收 $0.99 时，<strong>仅看推理这一项毛利高达 80–96%</strong>；但叠加检索管线、知识库索引、人工复核、监控与基础设施后，整体毛利回落到 50–60%——这中间的差额就是「基础设施税」（<a href=\"https://www.techtimes.com/articles/317542/20260601/ai-agent-economics-token-tax-locks-gross-margins-30-points-below-saas-baseline.htm\">TechTimes, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位经济模型-把毛利写成公式\">单位经济模型：把毛利写成公式</h2><p>把一笔结果制收入的单位毛利写清楚。设单结果售价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，每结果平均 API 调用次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，每次调用平均消耗输入 token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、输出 token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对应单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（每 token），单结果的边际基础设施成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>，则单位毛利率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = \\frac{p - n \\cdot (t_{in} \\cdot c_{in} + t_{out} \\cdot c_{out}) - i}{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入 Intercom 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{in}=1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{out}=600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span>，按 2026 年 Claude Sonnet 档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 8: c_{in}=\\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">c_{in}=\\</span></span>3/\\text{M}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>、</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">、</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span></span></span></span></span>c_{out}=$15/\\text{M}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>（即</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">（即</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（即</span></span></span></span></span>c_{in}=3\\times10^{-6}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>、</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">、</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span></span></span></span></span>c_{out}=15\\times10^{-6}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>）算，推理成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">）算，推理成本</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）算，推理成本</span></span></span></span></span>\\approx 4\\times(1500\\times3 + 600\\times15)\\times10^{-6} = $0.0534<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>，纯推理毛利率约</mtext><mn>95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">，纯推理毛利率约 95%。可见在价签里有缓冲、token 价又持续下跌时，结果制的推理毛利极其健康——危险全在那个</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，纯推理毛利率约</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span></span>i$（基础设施税）上。</p>\n<p>token 价正在塌方式下跌。2024 年初要拿到 GPT-4 级表现约需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>百万</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>，到</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年初这一成本下降超过</mtext><mn>98</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60/百万 token，到 2026 年初这一成本下降超过 98%，高效模型只要</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">百万</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，到</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年初这一成本下降超过</span><span class=\"mord\">98</span></span></span></span></span>0.30–$0.75/百万 token 就能给出相当的推理能力；行业整体价格从 2025 到 2026 约下降 80%（<a href=\"https://www.softwareseni.com/why-ai-gross-margins-are-so-much-lower-than-saas-and-what-that-means-for-your-business/\">SoftwareSeni, 2026</a>；<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison/\">CloudZero, 2026</a>）。下表是 2026 年中的代表性 API 价格（每百万 token，输入/输出）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>输入 ($/M)</th>\n<th>输出 ($/M)</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite</td>\n<td>0.10</td>\n<td>0.40</td>\n<td>最便宜的闭源 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek V3</td>\n<td>0.27</td>\n<td>1.10</td>\n<td>高性价比开源系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gemini 3.1 Pro</td>\n<td>2.00</td>\n<td>12.00</td>\n<td>当代旗舰最低价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-5.4</td>\n<td>2.50</td>\n<td>15.00</td>\n<td>生产主力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Sonnet 档</td>\n<td>3.00</td>\n<td>15.00</td>\n<td>高质量主力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Opus 4.7</td>\n<td>5.00</td>\n<td>25.00</td>\n<td>高端推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-5.4 Pro</td>\n<td>30.00</td>\n<td>180.00</td>\n<td>顶配旗舰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison/\">CloudZero, 2026</a>、<a href=\"https://intuitionlabs.ai/articles/ai-api-pricing-comparison-grok-gemini-openai-claude\">IntuitionLabs, 2026</a>。批处理通常再打五折。这张表对单位经济模型的含义是：换一档便宜模型常常就能把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 拉高十几个点，于是「模型路由」本身成了定价杠杆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格战-护城河与定价权\">价格战、护城河与定价权</h2><p>token 价每年塌一次，意味着纯粹建在别人推理之上的产品很难守住价格——成本优势会被同行下个季度的换模型抹平。GenAI 把「威胁出现→识别→响应」的传统周期从数年压缩到数月，连在位者赖以应对的时间缓冲都被抹掉了（<a href=\"https://boardmember.com/the-death-of-competitive-moats-in-the-genai-era/\">Corporate Board Member, 2026</a>）。在这种环境里，定价权来自护城河，而最硬的 AI 护城河是<strong>数据网络效应</strong>：每多一个用户都让系统对所有用户更好，匹配更准、噪声更低、信任更高，从而支撑你不被迫跟进每一次降价（<a href=\"https://greylock.com/greymatter/the-new-new-moats/\">Greylock, The New New Moats</a>）。</p>\n<p>下面的决策图把「定价模型选择」与「护城河强度」连起来：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[工作流是否定义清晰&lt;br/&gt;且可重复] --&gt;|是| B[结果制&lt;br/&gt;价签含 token 缓冲]&#10;  A --&gt;|否| C[用量是否波动大]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[用量制&lt;br/&gt;成本转嫁客户]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[混合制&lt;br/&gt;base + overage]&#10;  B --&gt; F{是否有数据网络效应}&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt;|有| G[可守价&lt;br/&gt;抵御价格战]&#10;  F --&gt;|无| H[只能跟跌&lt;br/&gt;毛利被推理价主导]\">flowchart TD\n  A[工作流是否定义清晰&lt;br/&gt;且可重复] --&gt;|是| B[结果制&lt;br/&gt;价签含 token 缓冲]\n  A --&gt;|否| C[用量是否波动大]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[用量制&lt;br/&gt;成本转嫁客户]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[混合制&lt;br/&gt;base + overage]\n  B --&gt; F{是否有数据网络效应}\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt;|有| G[可守价&lt;br/&gt;抵御价格战]\n  F --&gt;|无| H[只能跟跌&lt;br/&gt;毛利被推理价主导]</pre><p>市场已用脚投票。Sierra 由前 Salesforce 联席 CEO Bret Taylor 创办，从第一天就内建结果制定价，约 21 个月做到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>亿</mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mtext>，</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年初越过</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 亿 ARR，2026 年初越过</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年初越过</span></span></span></span></span>1.5 亿（<a href=\"https://sierra.ai/blog/outcome-based-pricing-for-ai-agents\">Sierra, 2026</a>）。HubSpot 把每解决工单从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mtext>砍到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.00 砍到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.00</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">砍到</span></span></span></span></span>0.50，正是用得起的 token 成本下跌换来的降价空间。Gartner 预测到 2030 年至少 40% 的企业 SaaS 支出会转向用量制、agent 制或结果制（<a href=\"https://www.techtimes.com/articles/317542/20260601/ai-agent-economics-token-tax-locks-gross-margins-30-points-below-saas-baseline.htm\">TechTimes, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>token 税是结构性的：AI 原生产品 2026 年毛利约 52%，仍比成熟 SaaS 低 23–33 个百分点，推理成本约吃掉收入的 23%。</li>\n<li>定价模型的本质是分配用量风险——用量制转嫁给客户（厂商毛利最稳）、席位制由厂商扛（正在崩，21%→15%）、结果制由厂商扛但靠价签缓冲获利，混合制双方分担（已是 41% 主流落点）。</li>\n<li>单位毛利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = (p - n(t_{in}c_{in}+t_{out}c_{out}) - i)/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>：纯推理项常能做到 90%+，真正的毛利杀手是基础设施税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>（检索、索引、人工复核、监控）。</li>\n<li>token 价两年跌超 98%（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60/M →</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span>0.30–0.75/M），换便宜模型 + 模型路由是直接的定价杠杆，但也意味着纯成本优势守不住。</li>\n<li>能守价的定价权来自护城河，尤其是数据网络效应——没有它，毛利就由不断下跌的 token 价主导，只能被动跟跌。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定价策略与单位经济模型","id":"定价策略与单位经济模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从席位费到 token 税","id":"核心概念-从席位费到-token-税"},{"level":2,"text":"三种定价模型与它们的毛利敏感度","id":"三种定价模型与它们的毛利敏感度"},{"level":2,"text":"单位经济模型：把毛利写成公式","id":"单位经济模型-把毛利写成公式"},{"level":2,"text":"价格战、护城河与定价权","id":"价格战-护城河与定价权"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"垂直 SaaS 与护城河侵蚀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/vertical-saas-and-moats"},"next":null}